  "__class__": "Meeting",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": "00:03:08.160",
      "end": "00:03:12.650",
      "text": "Can you do a sound check from Chambers, please?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": "00:03:12.650",
      "end": "00:03:13.520",
      "text": "You sound good."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:03:13.520",
      "end": "00:03:16.180",
      "text": "Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:03:16.180",
      "end": "00:03:17.870",
      "text": "Vercan, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:03:17.870",
      "end": "00:13:31.560",
      "text": "No problem."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:13:31.560",
      "end": "00:13:49.570",
      "text": "Call on colleagues, please, to have screens on."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:13:49.570",
      "end": "00:13:54.260",
      "text": "That's the correct firm quorum."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:13:54.260",
      "end": "00:13:56.520",
      "text": "I can confirm quorum, Your Worship."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:13:56.520",
      "end": "00:13:58.990",
      "text": "Thank you very much, colleagues."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:13:58.990",
      "end": "00:14:04.610",
      "text": "This is a special strategic priorities and policy meeting"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:14:04.610",
      "end": "00:14:05.750",
      "text": "with that."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:14:05.750",
      "end": "00:14:15.010",
      "text": "I will first ask for any disclosures of pecuniary interest."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:14:15.010",
      "end": "00:14:18.890",
      "text": "I see an undeclared, and I will now read out"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:14:18.890",
      "end": "00:14:22.220",
      "text": "the statements regarding virtual meeting and accessibility."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:14:22.220",
      "end": "00:14:24.680",
      "text": "And as the City of London is committed to making every effort"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:14:24.680",
      "end": "00:14:27.890",
      "text": "to provide alternate formats and communication supports"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:14:27.890",
      "end": "00:14:30.940",
      "text": "for council, standing or advisory committee meetings,"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:14:30.940",
      "end": "00:14:32.870",
      "text": "and information upon request."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:14:32.870",
      "end": "00:14:34.500",
      "text": "To make a request for any city service,"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:14:34.500",
      "end": "00:14:39.980",
      "text": "please contact accessibility@london.ca or 519-661-2489."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:14:39.980",
      "end": "00:14:46.180",
      "text": "So with that, colleagues, we have one item"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:14:46.180",
      "end": "00:14:50.580",
      "text": "on the consent agenda, 2.1 on your agenda."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:14:50.580",
      "end": "00:14:52.740",
      "text": "Dealing with the Streamline Development Approval Fund,"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:14:52.740",
      "end": "00:14:57.230",
      "text": "I wonder because this was called by virtue of its timeliness,"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:14:57.230",
      "end": "00:15:06.500",
      "text": "wonder if perhaps Mr. Cotsfis would take us through it."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:15:06.500",
      "end": "00:15:11.220",
      "text": "And I will go to Mr. Falver, please."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "00:15:11.220",
      "end": "00:15:12.990",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "00:15:12.990",
      "end": "00:15:15.140",
      "text": "Can everybody hear me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "00:15:15.140",
      "end": "00:15:16.460",
      "text": "We hear you fine."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "00:15:16.460",
      "end": "00:15:17.360",
      "text": "Great."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "00:15:17.360",
      "end": "00:15:20.720",
      "text": "So basically what we've got here is the provinces"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "00:15:20.720",
      "end": "00:15:24.600",
      "text": "providing us with about $1.7 million for us"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "00:15:24.600",
      "end": "00:15:29.500",
      "text": "to apply to efficiencies in the development process."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "00:15:29.500",
      "end": "00:15:31.120",
      "text": "So staff have taken a look."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "00:15:31.120",
      "end": "00:15:32.310",
      "text": "We have a number of different things"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "00:15:32.310",
      "end": "00:15:36.220",
      "text": "that we've been working on in our continuous improvement"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "00:15:36.220",
      "end": "00:15:40.960",
      "text": "strategy, lean six reviews of different processes,"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "00:15:40.960",
      "end": "00:15:45.270",
      "text": "even going as far as to bring in alignment"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "00:15:45.270",
      "end": "00:15:48.850",
      "text": "a number of the things associated with the reorg."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "00:15:48.850",
      "end": "00:15:54.140",
      "text": "So things like scanning paper files, moving paper files,"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "00:15:54.140",
      "end": "00:15:58.520",
      "text": "and then even bringing on staff to help with backlogs"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "00:15:58.520",
      "end": "00:16:02.800",
      "text": "for different applications."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "00:16:02.800",
      "end": "00:16:06.340",
      "text": "So, I mean, this is a wonderful thing for us."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": "00:16:06.340",
      "end": "00:16:09.360",
      "text": "This actually lets us speed up a number of the processes"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": "00:16:09.360",
      "end": "00:16:12.230",
      "text": "that we've been working on in the background."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": "00:16:12.230",
      "end": "00:16:14.450",
      "text": "And then they even could help support"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": "00:16:14.450",
      "end": "00:16:18.020",
      "text": "some of our digital transformation"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": "00:16:18.020",
      "end": "00:16:20.930",
      "text": "towards our strategic business case"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "00:16:20.930",
      "end": "00:16:24.340",
      "text": "to bring in a Planning Act application software tracking"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "00:16:24.340",
      "end": "00:16:27.180",
      "text": "system."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "00:16:27.180",
      "end": "00:16:29.970",
      "text": "Pretty much sums it up at this point."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "00:16:29.970",
      "end": "00:16:34.130",
      "text": "If there's anything further, please feel free to--"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": "00:16:34.130",
      "end": "00:16:35.480",
      "text": "Well, let's do that."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": "00:16:35.480",
      "end": "00:16:38.200",
      "text": "So before I request a mover and seconder,"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": "00:16:38.200",
      "end": "00:16:40.260",
      "text": "I'll ask if there are any questions from colleagues"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": "00:16:40.260",
      "end": "00:16:44.080",
      "text": "for Mr. Felbert."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": "00:16:44.080",
      "end": "00:16:47.170",
      "text": "Councillor Turner."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": "00:16:47.170",
      "end": "00:16:50.300",
      "text": "Just a quick question in terms of the metrics"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": "00:16:50.300",
      "end": "00:16:53.160",
      "text": "that the province will be looking for in exchange"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": "00:16:53.160",
      "end": "00:16:54.150",
      "text": "for the grants."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": "00:16:54.150",
      "end": "00:16:56.500",
      "text": "They typically have a suite of things"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": "00:16:56.500",
      "end": "00:16:58.250",
      "text": "that you have to report and deliverables."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": "00:16:58.250",
      "end": "00:17:01.940",
      "text": "And if these will also be reported up to us,"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": "00:17:01.940",
      "end": "00:17:05.070",
      "text": "just to see how our processes are improved as a result."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "00:17:05.070",
      "end": "00:17:07.910",
      "text": "Mr. Felbert."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "00:17:07.910",
      "end": "00:17:11.080",
      "text": "Yeah, this has been pretty fast and furious"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": "00:17:11.080",
      "end": "00:17:13.160",
      "text": "for actually working through the agreement right now."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": "00:17:13.160",
      "end": "00:17:17.990",
      "text": "But we'll be, I think we have until April"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": "00:17:17.990",
      "end": "00:17:19.660",
      "text": "to put together a list of projects"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": "00:17:19.660",
      "end": "00:17:22.650",
      "text": "that will be bringing forward."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "00:17:22.650",
      "end": "00:17:24.220",
      "text": "My assumption is that we would come back"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "00:17:24.220",
      "end": "00:17:28.020",
      "text": "and talk to you folks if appropriate."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "00:17:28.020",
      "end": "00:17:29.930",
      "text": "Councillor Turner, any follow-up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "00:17:29.930",
      "end": "00:17:30.850",
      "text": "That's a good thanks."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "00:17:30.850",
      "end": "00:17:35.910",
      "text": "Thank you, Councillor Hopkins."
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "00:17:35.910",
      "end": "00:17:37.110",
      "text": "Yeah, thank you, Mr. Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "00:17:37.110",
      "end": "00:17:39.300",
      "text": "And of course, very supportive of the city"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "00:17:39.300",
      "end": "00:17:42.130",
      "text": "taking advantage of the streamline funding"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "00:17:42.130",
      "end": "00:17:45.360",
      "text": "that's available 1.75 million, it's quite a bit of money."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "00:17:45.360",
      "end": "00:17:47.960",
      "text": "I know it's within a limited timeframe"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "00:17:47.960",
      "end": "00:17:52.780",
      "text": "but really I'm glad to see staff taking advantage"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "00:17:52.780",
      "end": "00:17:56.890",
      "text": "and getting the timelines for these agreements"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": "00:17:56.890",
      "end": "00:17:59.440",
      "text": "to take place to the province."
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": "00:17:59.440",
      "end": "00:18:02.070",
      "text": "I just have general comments"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": "00:18:02.070",
      "end": "00:18:08.100",
      "text": "and I was really pleased to see temporary staff"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": "00:18:08.100",
      "end": "00:18:13.400",
      "text": "in getting the internship programs"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": "00:18:15.230",
      "end": "00:18:18.830",
      "text": "and supporting diversification on planning"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": "00:18:18.830",
      "end": "00:18:20.210",
      "text": "and building departments."
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": "00:18:20.210",
      "end": "00:18:24.250",
      "text": "And I know we're looking more at the internship there"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": "00:18:24.250",
      "end": "00:18:27.730",
      "text": "but I would hope that there would be opportunities"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": "00:18:27.730",
      "end": "00:18:32.300",
      "text": "to take advantage of the funding"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": "00:18:32.300",
      "end": "00:18:37.310",
      "text": "from the planning and development process of policies"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": "00:18:37.310",
      "end": "00:18:40.560",
      "text": "that we really can do."
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": "00:18:40.560",
      "end": "00:18:44.480",
      "text": "I know a number of them are being set aside for now"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": "00:18:44.480",
      "end": "00:18:48.270",
      "text": "but as we look at offering internships to graduates"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": "00:18:48.270",
      "end": "00:18:51.220",
      "text": "with focusing on disabilities and diversity"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": "00:18:51.220",
      "end": "00:18:54.330",
      "text": "and indigenous and Black and racial and gender,"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": "00:18:54.330",
      "end": "00:18:58.080",
      "text": "we can also take that opportunity to look at how policies"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": "00:18:58.080",
      "end": "00:19:02.630",
      "text": "and how we can incorporate that in our planning policies."
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": "00:19:02.630",
      "end": "00:19:04.830",
      "text": "I know we've had a number of conversations"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": "00:19:04.830",
      "end": "00:19:08.060",
      "text": "in the past as well about better ways"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": "00:19:08.060",
      "end": "00:19:09.890",
      "text": "to improve public participation,"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": "00:19:09.890",
      "end": "00:19:13.290",
      "text": "better ways to improve our agendas, et cetera."
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": "00:19:13.290",
      "end": "00:19:16.080",
      "text": "I think those are important projects"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": "00:19:16.080",
      "end": "00:19:21.070",
      "text": "that we will be able to take advantage of through this funding"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": "00:19:21.070",
      "end": "00:19:27.270",
      "text": "and just wanted to make those comments known at this meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": "00:19:27.270",
      "end": "00:19:28.200",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": "00:19:28.200",
      "end": "00:19:29.020",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Felberg."
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": "00:19:29.020",
      "end": "00:19:34.450",
      "text": "Any comment with respect to Councillor Hopkins comments yourself."
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": "00:19:34.450",
      "end": "00:19:35.280",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": "00:19:35.280",
      "end": "00:19:37.700",
      "text": "Maybe Mr. Barrett might wanna fill in afterwards"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": "00:19:37.700",
      "end": "00:19:41.470",
      "text": "but did speak with Ms. Morris prior to putting in our list"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": "00:19:41.470",
      "end": "00:19:45.080",
      "text": "of planned projects and we did talk about some possibilities"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": "00:19:45.080",
      "end": "00:19:50.230",
      "text": "of including some looks at EDI policies for the city"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": "00:19:50.230",
      "end": "00:19:53.920",
      "text": "or potentially planning policies."
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": "00:19:53.920",
      "end": "00:19:56.930",
      "text": "Not sure if Mr. Barrett has anything further to add to that."
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": "00:19:56.930",
      "end": "00:19:58.630",
      "text": "Mr. Barrett."
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": "00:19:58.630",
      "end": "00:19:59.710",
      "text": "Thank you, Your Worship."
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": "00:19:59.710",
      "end": "00:20:02.740",
      "text": "Just part of what we could look at through this"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": "00:20:02.740",
      "end": "00:20:04.290",
      "text": "is just broadening that out a little bit"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": "00:20:04.290",
      "end": "00:20:06.650",
      "text": "is on the public consultation process"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": "00:20:06.650",
      "end": "00:20:08.200",
      "text": "as part of the whole streamlining in ways"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": "00:20:08.200",
      "end": "00:20:10.710",
      "text": "that we have a better outreach to broader communities"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": "00:20:10.710",
      "end": "00:20:14.660",
      "text": "and what we're then who were able to reach now."
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": "00:20:14.660",
      "end": "00:20:16.450",
      "text": "So that could be part of,"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": "00:20:16.450",
      "end": "00:20:18.520",
      "text": "as part of the streamlining is actually having a better way"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": "00:20:18.520",
      "end": "00:20:21.430",
      "text": "to deal with the public and more efficient way to consult"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": "00:20:21.430",
      "end": "00:20:22.270",
      "text": "with the public."
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": "00:20:22.270",
      "end": "00:20:24.020",
      "text": "So that's certainly something that we could look at"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": "00:20:24.020",
      "end": "00:20:26.160",
      "text": "as one of the projects to incorporate."
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": "00:20:26.160",
      "end": "00:20:26.950",
      "text": "Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": "00:20:26.950",
      "end": "00:20:30.590",
      "text": "Any other comments or questions?"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": "00:20:30.590",
      "end": "00:20:34.050",
      "text": "Always nice when the province wants to give us some money"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": "00:20:34.050",
      "end": "00:20:36.000",
      "text": "and this is not just a little money"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": "00:20:36.000",
      "end": "00:20:37.580",
      "text": "because it relates to continuous improvement."
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": "00:20:37.580",
      "end": "00:20:40.320",
      "text": "So with that, I'll look for a motion to approve."
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": "00:20:40.320",
      "end": "00:20:42.090",
      "text": "Councillor Layman, seconded by Councillor Hopkins."
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": "00:20:42.090",
      "end": "00:20:43.490",
      "text": "Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": "00:20:43.490",
      "end": "00:21:00.810",
      "text": "We've had discussion, let's call the vote."
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": "00:21:00.810",
      "end": "00:21:02.410",
      "text": "I vote, yeah, in your Worship."
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": "00:21:02.410",
      "end": "00:21:09.280",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": "00:21:09.280",
      "end": "00:21:13.700",
      "text": "In the vote, the motion's passed 15 to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "start": "00:21:13.700",
      "end": "00:21:16.680",
      "text": "We have no scheduled items, no items for direction."
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "start": "00:21:16.680",
      "end": "00:21:19.020",
      "text": "We have no deferred matters, no additional business."
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "start": "00:21:19.020",
      "end": "00:21:21.440",
      "text": "So with that, I'll look for a motion to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "start": "00:21:21.440",
      "end": "00:21:24.610",
      "text": "We'll by Councillor Van Hal seconded by Councillor Palosa."
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "start": "00:21:24.610",
      "end": "00:21:25.870",
      "text": "We'll turn your attention to the screen"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "start": "00:21:25.870",
      "end": "00:21:41.980",
      "text": "as we conclude the meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "start": "00:21:41.980",
      "end": "00:21:46.130",
      "text": "Closing the vote, the motion's passed 15 to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "start": "00:21:46.130",
      "end": "00:21:46.970",
      "text": "Clearly meeting adjourned."
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "start": "00:21:46.970",
      "end": "00:21:48.330",
      "text": "We'll see you all back at four o'clock."
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "start": "00:21:48.330",
      "end": "00:21:48.700",
      "text": "Thank you."
    }
  ],
  "transcript_source": "lillian_skinner_archive",
